Code to reproduce the analysis and plots in the manuscript.

The data these scripts read is kept separately in ../05_data.

See README.md for full instructions (quick start, dependencies, and which
script produces which figure).

Contents:
  scripts/         figure-generation scripts (paper figures 1-6 and SI figures)
  reference_figs/  the figures as they appear in the final paper, for comparison
  analysis         original script that derives diagnostics from raw SCREAM
                   output on NERSC (paths under /pscratch and /global/cfs);
                   kept for reference, not needed to regenerate the figures
